# Own cell (no ICDD input). Predicted OQMD 1992237 MnAl2Au6 (C2/m, a C11b superstructure: Mn and Al
# order on the C11b 2a sublattice, Au on 4e) with the Mn/Al order kept and the Au order reduced to eta = 0.5 by the
# occ() rule of scripts/phaseid_order_ladder.py: each Mn or Al site carries Au (1 - eta) x 2/3 = 1/3 and keeps its own
# element at 2/3; each Au site carries (Mn,Al) 1/6 at Mn:Al = 1:2 (Au 5/6, Al 1/9, Mn 1/18). Averaged over the 2a
# sublattice this is exactly the C11b eta0.50 ladder cell (results/phaseid/0479/order_ladder/eta0.50.cif).
# Lattice: the C11b ladder cell (a = 3.333, c = 8.897 A) taken to the C2/m cell by the StructureMatcher supercell
# matrix [[-1, -1, -1], [0, 0, 1], [-1, 2, 1]]; DFT fractional coordinates kept. The DFT primitive lengths are [1.0223, 1.0223, 1.009]
# times these (beyond the driver's 2 % main-cell window, so the DFT cell is not used).
# generated using pymatgen
